      "title": "Monstrous Liminality; Or, The Uncanny Strangers of Secularized Modernity",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Robert G. Beghetto",
          "openalex_id": "A5017164412",
          "orcid": "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8048-4698",
